        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-25T17:50:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honestly, if you already had Bee-bot out, Apocalypse didn't threaten you at all. Hell, have two Bee-Bots out, let Apocalypse take out one to remove the Meteors, then the other to hit Cryo and take out Apocalypse (after letting Apocalypse take out the demons for you).</p><p>Apostate is actually really good for Unity in general, because all of his 'every turn' ongoing damage hits the highest HP target until he flips, so the Bots tend not to be targeted at all except for when the one one-shot comes out.</p>",
